    <preface>
      <p>Indigenous Education (Targeted Assistance) Amendment Act 2013</p>
      <p>No. 66, 2013</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Indigenous Education (Targeted Assistance) Act 2000</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
